config BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_ADAFRUIT_CIRCUITPYTHON_RGB_DISPLAY
	bool "python-adafruit-circuitpython-rgb-display"
	help
	Port of display drivers from 
	https://github.com/adafruit/micropython-adafruit-rgb-display 
	to Adafruit CircuitPython for use on Adafruit’s SAMD21-based 
	and other CircuitPython boards.

	  https://pypi.org/project/adafruit-circuitpython-rgb-display/
